<title>USA: Orange National Bancorp Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Orange National Bancorp Q3 net rises.</headline>
<text>
<p>ORANGE, Calif., Oct 7 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.31		    $0.31</p>
<p> Net		 611			589</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.77		    $0.97</p>
<p> Net		 1,496		    1.865</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Total assets increased 4.4 percent from $211.2 million on Sept. 30, 1995, to $220.5 million as of Sept. 30, 1996. Total loans outstanding decreased slightly by $3.6 million between the two like periods, reflecting continued softness in loan demand and a most competitive marketplace.</p>
</text>
